This repository contains the AGPL-3.0-or-later desktop client for Ramflux. It
depends on the BSD-3-Clause Ramflux core workspace maintained in the
ramfluxhq/ramflux repository.

This product includes GPUI Kit (https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit) and
GPUI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This product bundles the following fonts, each licensed under the SIL Open
Font License, Version 1.1 (full texts in the licenses/ directory):

- Hanken Grotesk, Copyright 2021 The Hanken Grotesk Project Authors
  (https://github.com/marcologous/hanken-grotesk). The upstream license
  declares no Reserved Font Name.
  License: licenses/OFL-HankenGrotesk.txt
- Noto Sans SC (official SC subset), Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe
  (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name 'Source'.
  License: licenses/OFL-NotoSansSC.txt

The bundled files are not the upstream files. They are static Regular (400),
Medium (500) and SemiBold (600) instances derived with fontTools from the
upstream variable fonts (HankenGrotesk[wght].ttf and the Noto Sans SC
SubsetOTF variable font), with their name tables set for each weight; the
glyph outlines are as instanced, not edited. Under the OFL they are Modified
Versions. They keep the family names Hanken Grotesk and Noto Sans SC, which
are not Reserved Font Names, and no Reserved Font Name ('Source') is used in
any of their names.
